time.\n- **\"Good morning\"** works **only** in the morning.\n\nThey are not the same. \"Good morning\" is not a general \"hello\".\n\nEveryday example: you see your neighbour at 8 p.m. and say \"Good morning!\" Your neighbour may smile and think, \"It's night now!\"\n\nSo, for any time of day, choose **\"Hello\"**. It is always safe.\n\n**Your task:** Introduce a man you know to your manager. Write two sentences: his name, then his job.","transport":"json","replyVersion":"enara-ai","languageTurn":{"version":"ltc-v1","lessonId":"ltb-lsn-001","objectiveId":"ltb-obj-001","skill":"written_interaction","moves":["corrective_feedback_retry","comprehensible_model"],"reasonCodes":["answer_to_instruction","level_novice_prompt_first","recurrence_unknown_after_shift","level_beginner","during_feedback"],"supportRequested":false,"confusionSignals":0,"answeringCheck":true,"proficiency":{"status":"inferred","value":"A2","source":"course_level"},"nextStep":"learner_retry","provenance":"deterministic_turn_signals","confidence":"low","masteryClaim":false,"policyRevision":"ltc-v1-r4.3","pendingTask":"instruction","learnerResponse":"answer","learnerIntent":"PARTIAL_ANSWER_ATTEMPT","stateScope":"3102a06eec317ebdb1c4288a","attemptsOnTask":5,"lengthTarget":{"targetWords":90,"maxWords":140,"basis":"adult:a2"},"errorRecurrence":"unknown","ageBand":"adult","ageBandStatus":"known","ageBandSource":"school_setting_adult_learners","confirmedSuccessStreak":0,"hintLevelOffered":1,"activeItemBefore":{"id":"msg:msg-1794569532978-2by7","source":"tutor"},"assessment":{"verdict":"CORRECT","relevance":"ACTIVE_ITEM","criteria":[1],"next":"NEW_ITEM","item":"L1-INTRO-OTHER-HE","source":"tutor_assessment"},"activeItem":{"id":"msg:msg-1794569539809-hck7","source":"tutor"},"hintLevel":0,"qualityFlags":[],"markerStatus":"ok"},"teaching":{"decisionId":"pd-5e91c680-b741-4a2f-b9a5-2c348fa34ce0","objectiveId":"ltb-obj-001","objectiveResolution":"lesson","primary":"formative_feedback","supporting":["retrieval_pract