eet you.\"** is also correct for a first meeting.\n\nNow a new step: **introducing another person.**\n\nWe use two short sentences:\n**This is + name. He's / She's a + job.**\n\n*My example:* \"This is Karim. He's a teacher.\"\n\n**Your task:** At the dinner, your friend Sara is with you. Omar doesn't know her. Write two sentences to introduce Sara to Omar, and say her job. Use a job that is not *teacher*.","transport":"json","replyVersion":"enara-ai","languageTurn":{"version":"ltc-v1","lessonId":"ltb-lsn-002","objectiveId":"ltb-obj-002","skill":"written_interaction","moves":["corrective_feedback_retry","comprehensible_model"],"reasonCodes":["answer_to_sentence_frame","level_novice_prompt_first","recurrence_unknown","after_confirmed_success","level_beginner","during_feedback"],"supportRequested":false,"confusionSignals":0,"answeringCheck":true,"proficiency":{"status":"inferred","value":"A2","source":"course_level"},"nextStep":"learner_retry","provenance":"deterministic_turn_signals","confidence":"low","masteryClaim":false,"policyRevision":"ltc-v1-r4.3","pendingTask":"sentence_frame","learnerResponse":"answer","learnerIntent":"ANSWER_ATTEMPT","stateScope":"510f2a49ca756ca0fc74d56c","attemptsOnTask":1,"lengthTarget":{"targetWords":90,"maxWords":140,"basis":"adult:a2"},"errorRecurrence":"unknown","ageBand":"adult","ageBandStatus":"known","ageBandSource":"school_setting_adult_learners","confirmedSuccessStreak":1,"hintLevelOffered":1,"activeItemBefore":{"id":"msg:msg-1794569558896-g472","source":"tutor"},"assessment":{"verdict":"CORRECT","relevance":"ACTIVE_ITEM","criteria":[1],"next":"NEW_ITEM","item":"LTB-002-introduce-other","source":"tutor_assessment"},"activeItem":{"id":"msg:msg-1794569566392-honj","source":"tutor"},"hintLevel":0,"qualityFlags":[],"markerStatus":"ok"},"teaching":{"decisionId":"pd-16514ae1-226b-4d5a-807b-a1b64b465073","objectiveId":"ltb-obj-002","objectiveResolution":"lesson","primary":"formative_feedback","supporting":["retrieval_practice"],"modifie